# The facilitator pack's plaintext source. The repo ships only the
# enciphered blob inside js/data.js. Keep this file out of the repo.
.facilitator-src/

.DS_Store
node_modules/
.vercel
.env*

# ---- lecture answer keys ----
# Same rule as .facilitator-src/ above: this repo is public, and a labelled
# eval set in a public repo is a set that no longer measures anything. The
# scripts, the criteria sheet, the guardrail table and the tool-change spec
# are all here; the answers are not.
#
# These live only on the facilitator's machine. There is no generator in the
# repo that rebuilds them, because the generator IS the answer key. Back them
# up, or re-encipher them through build-fac.js the way the hidden set is.
lecture/tickets.json
lecture/build-tickets.js
lecture/outputs.json
lecture/deck.html
lecture/RECONCILIATION.md
agent-bench/tasks.js
agent-bench/report.json
agent-bench/runs/

# Student submissions and the facilitator's own stage-5 prompt. p1 and p2 are
# other people's work; p3 is a model answer to stage 5.
lecture/prompts/*
!lecture/prompts/README.md
